# UI/UX design theme - enterprise system

Dense, data-forward, SAP-inspired enterprise style. Calm neutral surfaces, one
strong brand blue, color reserved for status meaning - not decoration.

**Consistency first:** every page must feel like the same product. Tables,
body text, captions, and card surfaces share one system — see
`03-ui-consistency.mdc`.

## Color tokens (use as CSS variables, never hardcode hex in components)

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--color-primary` | #0854A0 | Top nav, primary buttons, active nav, links |
| `--color-primary-dark` | #1F3864 | Headers, emphasis text on light backgrounds |
| `--color-accent` | #2E74B5 | Secondary actions, chart accents |
| `--color-success` | #2E7D32 | Approved, completed, on-time |
| `--color-warning` | #B26A00 | On hold, correction raised, due soon |
| `--color-danger` | #B00020 | Rejected, overdue, validation errors |
| `--color-info` | #0277BD | Informational banners, waiting states |
| `--color-neutral-900` | #1A1A1A | Primary body text |
| `--color-neutral-500` | #6B7280 | Secondary text, captions |
| `--color-neutral-100` | #F2F2F2 | Table header / muted striping |
| `--color-surface` | #FFFFFF | Page/card background |
| `--color-border` | #D9DEE4 | Table borders, card outlines |

## Typography (same on every page)

- Font: Inter or Roboto, `system-ui` fallback (inherit — never override per page).
- H1 24px/semibold (PageHeader only), H2 18px/semibold (AppCard / section).
- Body 14px/regular, caption 12px/regular muted, KPI numerics 20–28px
  semibold with tabular-nums.

## Layout & components

- Left sidebar + top bar; content via `.page-shell`.
- Cards: `AppCard` only (8px radius, 1px border, light shadow).
- Tables: `DataTable` / `.app-table` only — one header style, one body style.
- Status/Priority: shared badges; Buttons: `AppButton` / `AppButtonLink`.
- Loading / empty / error / permission-denied on every data screen.

## Accessibility

- WCAG 2.1 AA contrast; keyboard for timer/approvals; ARIA on icon-only buttons.
